  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The study was conducted during late winter–early spring (March–April) of 2023 and 2024 on first-year sea ice in Qikiqtait (Belcher Islands), Hudson Bay. In 2023, sampling was performed along a ~10-km transect comprising five sites (P1–P5) sampled every other day between 1 and 15 April. In 2024, a distributed sampling was implemented across the archipelago to characterize spatial patterns in ice-algal production and potential nutrient sources from 18 March to 1 April."
